WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:05.638
Russia is

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:06.439
stepping up its

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:07.307
aerial assault

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:08.975
on the Ukrainian capital Kiev,

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:11.011
and is apparently changing tactics

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:12.946
by launching missile and drone attacks

00:00:12.946 --> 00:00:15.415
during the day, not just at night.

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:24.090
This video shows

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:25.191
children screaming

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:27.060
in fear as they run to a shelter

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:27.794
Ukraine says

00:00:27.794 --> 00:00:29.162
air defenses shot down

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:30.230
dozens of cruise

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:31.531
missiles and drones

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:33.233
launched at the Capitol.

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:35.101
But even missiles that get shot down

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:36.569
still, of course, pose a danger.

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:39.072
This falling debris don't hit a car.

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:41.408
After Ukraine intercepted

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:43.309
a missile attack.

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:44.544
Ukrainian military officials

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:46.579
are vowing swift retaliation

00:00:46.646 --> 00:00:48.248
for the Russian aerial attacks.

00:00:48.248 --> 00:00:49.916
All of this comes as Ukraine's

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:51.451
top general hints

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:53.620
that his country's counter offensive

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:55.288
could be imminent.

00:00:55.288 --> 00:00:56.189
CNN's

00:00:56.189 --> 00:00:57.590
Sam Kiley joins us live

00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:59.192
now from eastern Ukraine.

00:00:59.192 --> 00:00:59.526
And Sam,

00:00:59.526 --> 00:01:00.994
you've actually just spent some time

00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:02.062
with recruits

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:03.963
who could see the front line any day now.

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:04.697
What did you learn

00:01:08.935 --> 00:01:09.669
Well, yes.

00:01:09.669 --> 00:01:10.103
I mean, in the

00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:11.638
context of what's going on in

00:01:11.638 --> 00:01:12.572
Kiev, clearly

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:13.940
the Russians are returning

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:14.774
to their tactic

00:01:14.774 --> 00:01:15.141
of trying

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:15.475
to go

00:01:15.475 --> 00:01:17.944
after targets where they could maximize

00:01:17.944 --> 00:01:19.479
the death and damage

00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:21.648
they do to civilian infrastructure

00:01:21.648 --> 00:01:23.149
and to people themselves.

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:24.851
And that has provoked

00:01:24.851 --> 00:01:26.219
commanders here on the ground,

00:01:26.219 --> 00:01:28.021
not really threatening retaliation,

00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:29.689
but once again,

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:33.493
saying that the imminent counteroffensive

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:36.162
is just that it is close

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:37.831
and it is threatening to Russia.

00:01:37.831 --> 00:01:39.032
But the Ukrainians themselves

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:40.600
are under no illusions

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.135
as to what that will mean

00:01:42.135 --> 00:01:45.972
to ordinary soldiers themselves.

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:50.977
These are new recruits training.

00:01:50.977 --> 00:01:53.480
They could be on the frontline

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:55.815
in a couple of weeks.

00:02:08.661 --> 00:02:10.730
in training, mistakes are harmless.

00:02:11.097 --> 00:02:12.532
And what happened to you?

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:15.201
How long have you been doing this?

00:02:15.201 --> 00:02:15.602
Training

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:24.310
What do you think about the

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:25.145
coming offensive?

00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:26.946
Do you want to get involved

00:02:27.547 --> 00:02:30.450
because you're not worried

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:31.151
These young men.

00:02:31.151 --> 00:02:32.785
They've been having quite a lot of fun

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:34.521
running around in the woods

00:02:34.521 --> 00:02:36.723
and sometimes things get quite funny.

00:02:36.923 --> 00:02:37.957
But ultimately,

00:02:37.957 --> 00:02:40.660
this business is deadly serious.

00:02:42.262 --> 00:02:43.930
These recruits could be weeks away

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:46.366
from combat, pretend war.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:48.635
Turning to this,

00:02:48.635 --> 00:02:50.670
where death is all too real

00:03:11.791 --> 00:03:14.227
wounded veteran Colonel Alexander Peskin

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:15.895
runs the training.

00:03:34.514 --> 00:03:36.783
That experience is hard won.

00:03:36.783 --> 00:03:38.518
Alexander came face to face

00:03:38.518 --> 00:03:39.419
with a Russian

00:03:39.419 --> 00:03:41.588
who shot him in Bakhmut last week.

00:03:41.588 --> 00:03:43.923
What would you say to young volunteers

00:03:44.257 --> 00:03:45.225
or conscripts?

00:03:45.225 --> 00:03:46.226
Joining me now

00:03:51.864 --> 00:03:53.166
the hospital's got plans

00:03:53.166 --> 00:03:55.101
for dealing with Ukraine's offensive,

00:03:55.101 --> 00:03:57.337
which is expected this summer.

00:04:08.848 --> 00:04:10.383
For Colonel

00:04:10.383 --> 00:04:11.451
Pushkin knows that

00:04:11.451 --> 00:04:13.086
this will not be his last

00:04:13.086 --> 00:04:15.255
memorial service.

00:04:17.123 --> 00:04:19.959
This military cemetery has space to grow.

00:04:20.727 --> 00:04:22.061
Soldiers are confronted

00:04:22.061 --> 00:04:23.963
with grim truth here

00:04:23.963 --> 00:04:26.733
that many young men are forever entombed

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:31.471
in this parade of graves

00:04:35.575 --> 00:04:36.276
Now Zain

00:04:36.276 --> 00:04:38.411
Clearly, that is a rather grim

00:04:38.411 --> 00:04:41.114
reminder of what really happens here.

00:04:41.714 --> 00:04:43.850
To so many Ukrainian forces.

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:45.084
But this is also

00:04:45.084 --> 00:04:46.386
a message that the Ukrainians

00:04:46.386 --> 00:04:47.954
have been trying to send to the Russians

00:04:47.954 --> 00:04:49.188
now for some time.

00:04:49.188 --> 00:04:50.223
Both of the attacks

00:04:50.223 --> 00:04:51.791
against their logistics bases,

00:04:51.791 --> 00:04:53.559
which have been increasing,

00:04:53.559 --> 00:04:54.994
but also with a wide

00:04:54.994 --> 00:04:57.930
range of their own social media posts,

00:04:57.930 --> 00:05:00.066
all suggesting to the Russians

00:05:00.066 --> 00:05:00.900
that they might want to think

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:03.069
about running away rather than fighting

00:05:05.171 --> 00:05:06.372
Sam Kiley live for us there

00:05:06.372 --> 00:05:07.206
Thank you so much.

